          "name": "publish",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:37346b235e507209b5406a19ed049bf0742ce60596261db830bcc4de1df7dbf0",
          "description": "Publish Markdown or HTML as a hosted dochost page and get a shareable URL. Respects your plan: link lifetime, password protection, custom slug, and branding all follow your account entitlements. Paid plans publish without dochost branding by default — pass noBranding: false to keep the mark.",
