          "description": "Replace the content of one of your pages in place. The URL, view/like counts, and expiry stay the same; only the body, format, and title change. Resending identical content is a no-op. Prefer this over publishing again whenever the user is revising something you already published for them — a second publish creates a second link and strands the one they already shared.",
